    <releaseNotes>v16.2 RELEASE (Build 3211) - 2026-08-29

  FIXED - Missing updated language files.
  FIXED - 2 Stability issues
 
 v16.2 RELEASE (Build 3210) - 2026-08-28

  FIXED - Packing folders with the 7-Zip extension failed with "Operation not supported".
  FIXED - Issue with Inactive/Active tab colors was not set correctly when  NOT solid color was used.
  FIXED - Crash issue with SFTP and whyen creating folders
  FIXED - Crash issue when new files was added and removed almost directly again.
  FIXED - Duplicate Quick Favorites when opening the Favorites window
  FIXED - Tip Of the Day #29 is now shown again
  FIXED - 4+ Stability issuesd

 v16.2 RELEASE (Build 3205) - 2026-08-19

  FIXED - Password-protected ZIP extraction failed even after entering the correct password.
  FIXED - Crash when aborting archive extraction.
  FIXED - Find Files did not handle volume root paths correctly.
  FIXED - Crash in button editor when opening User Defined Commands dialog.
  FIXED - File operation crash when confirmation dialog was declined, and removed 10s wait timeout for the confirm dialog.
  FIXED - Startup probing of device will now log more details when probing takes long time.
  FIXED - Filename filtering did not respect language settings.
  FIXED - 10+ Stability issues</releaseNotes>
